{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a busy harbor. Draw <strong>routes</strong> to guide each ship to its color-matched dock. Once docked, <strong>cargo</strong> is transferred and ships set off again, meaning you'll need to manage both incoming and outgoing vessels carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/54ccf1910ca966471811d693ab1dc263.poster.avif?t=1767400427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/54ccf1910ca966471811d693ab1dc263.webm?t=1767400427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/54ccf1910ca966471811d693ab1dc263.mp4?t=1767400427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As traffic intensifies, every decision matters. Weave small, nimble <strong>boats</strong> between massive\u00a0<strong>freighters</strong>, coordinate multiple routes at once, and keep the harbor running smoothly even as it becomes increasingly crowded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/8e0e3ef394700f3f0d567fe2f89ba748.poster.avif?t=1767400427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/8e0e3ef394700f3f0d567fe2f89ba748.webm?t=1767400427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/extras/8e0e3ef394700f3f0d567fe2f89ba748.mp4?t=1767400427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw precise <strong>routes</strong> to guide ships through busy waters to their color-matched docks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your harbors and fleets, and score extra <strong>points</strong> by docking ships perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate unique <strong>harbors</strong> inspired by real ports around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>vessels</strong> of different sizes, each with distinct speed and handling characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, abstract <strong>visuals</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and <strong>compete</strong> globally on the leaderboards.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672760?t=1767400427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/cfc063d8b4b770d72641730f6abd33d78556c8f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767400427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/e58cff77cd36bbaba8f95e8998d26479ab8ca8ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767400427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/e58cff77cd36bbaba8f95e8998d26479ab8ca8ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767400427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":