748.mp4?t=1767400427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw precise <strong>routes</strong> to guide ships through busy waters to their color-matched docks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your harbors and fleets, and score extra <strong>points</strong> by docking ships perfectly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate unique <strong>harbors</strong> inspired by real ports around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>vessels</strong> of different sizes, each with distinct speed and handling characteristics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, abstract <strong>visuals</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and <strong>compete</strong> globally on the leaderboards.</p></li></ul>","developers":["NFold Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672760/99e4ef557906ff56afe959b690684257dff826e1/header.jpg?t=1767400427","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672760/1265910108/f1bdfa20e92713f3018eda3a38f595cfbfb9650c/1767399815/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767400427","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672760/1265910108/f1bdfa20e92713f3018eda3a38f595cfbfb9650c/1767399815/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767400427","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.st